{"id":1492347,"slug":"bude-l-p-2016","title":"Bude líp","title_en":"Better Things","year":2016,"rating":68,"votes_count":389,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Komediální seriálBude lípse soustředí na Sam Foxovou (Pamela Adlonová), svobodnou pracující herečku bez zábran, která v Los Angeles vychovává své tři dcery – Max, Frankie a Duke. Musí zastat roli matky, otce, soudce i policajta. A také dohlíží na svoji matku Phil, přistěhovanou z Anglie a žijící naproti přes ulici. Sam dělá spoustu chyb, ovšem své děti i matku bezmezně miluje a občas, když se vůči nim cítí provinile, je svou láskou doslova zahrnuje. V podstatě se jen snaží vydělat si na živobytí, vychovat své dcery, odreagovat se s přáteli, a také si sem tam ušetřit chvilku jen sama pro sebe.(HBO Europe)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBphB54wEuVh9CMSy5NmJQQUklL.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wjx1GfVyaATVbKozljXjQZZulNy.jpg","trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Komedie","Drama"],"tags":[],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Louis C.K.","Pamela Adlon","Nisha Ganatra","Lance Bangs"],"actors":["Pamela Adlon","Mikey Madison","Dale Dickey","Andrea Gabriel","Lachlan Watson","Michael Hyatt","Celia Imrie","Julie Bowen","Bradley Whitford","Mather Zickel","Constance Zimmer","David Herman","Christine Scott Bennett","Cleopatra Coleman","Alysia Reiner","Patricia Scanlon","José Zúñiga","Rae Dawn Chong","Ansley Gordon","Mike Cochrane","Lucy Davis","Rati Gupta","Rebecca Metz","Sarah Baker","Bridger Zadina","Hana Mae Lee","Tom Amandes","Laura Bilgeri","Parvesh Cheena","Hannah Riley","Olivia Edward","David Duchovny","Lenny Kravitz","Michael Jerome Moore","Diedrich Bader","Chris Williams","David Alan Basche","Dillon Lane","Charles Parnell","Lidia Porto","Deborah S. Craig","Matthew Glave","Ivy George","Chris Aquilino","Greg Cromer","John W. Allen","Adam Kulbersh","Arturo del Puerto","Erich Wildpret","Markus Flanagan","Doc Farrow","Harrison Page","Kev